{
  "header": "<header class=\"world-header\"><a class=\"world-brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Aman Singh — home\"><img src=\"/assets/aman-singh.jpg\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" alt=\"\"><span>Aman Singh<span class=\"brand-dot\">.</span></span></a><nav id=\"world-nav\" aria-label=\"World navigation\"><a href=\"/\">Portfolio</a><a href=\"/trading\" aria-current=\"page\">Trading World</a><a href=\"/youtube\">YouTube</a><a href=\"/instagram\">Instagram</a></nav><button type=\"button\" class=\"atlas-trigger\" data-open-atlas aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"world-atlas\" hidden><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"5\" ry=\"10\" transform=\"rotate(35 12 12)\"/></g><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/></svg><span>Explore worlds</span><small>02 / 04</small></button><div class=\"world-controls\"><button class=\"theme-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Switch to light theme\" title=\"Switch color theme\">◐</button><button class=\"world-motion\" aria-label=\"Pause animations\" aria-pressed=\"false\" title=\"Pause animations\" type=\"button\">Ⅱ</button><button class=\"world-menu\" type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"world-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Menu <span aria-hidden=\"true\">☰</span></button></div></header>",
  "atlas": "<dialog class=\"atlas-dialog\" id=\"world-atlas\" aria-labelledby=\"atlas-title\"><div class=\"atlas-dialog-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE AMAN ATLAS / 01—04</p><h2 id=\"atlas-title\">One mind. Four worlds.</h2></div><button class=\"atlas-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close world atlas\">×</button></div><div class=\"atlas-body\"><div class=\"atlas-astrolabe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"atlas-orbits\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"166\"/><circle class=\"orbit-wire\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"145\"/><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"125\" ry=\"68\" transform=\"rotate(-35 200 200)\"/><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" rx=\"125\" ry=\"68\" transform=\"rotate(35 200 200)\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"86\"/><path d=\"M200 15v35m0 300v35M15 200h35m300 0h35\"/><circle class=\"orbit-satellite\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"34\" r=\"5\"/></svg><div class=\"atlas-core\"><span>YOUR NEXT COORDINATE</span><strong data-atlas-number>02</strong><small data-atlas-caption>Trade With Zuko</small></div><span class=\"atlas-coordinate north\">CURIOUS BY NATURE</span><span class=\"atlas-coordinate south\">CONNECTED BY AMAN</span><span class=\"atlas-coordinate west\">∞</span><span class=\"atlas-coordinate east\">✳</span></div><nav class=\"atlas-links\" aria-label=\"World atlas\"><a href=\"/\" data-atlas-number=\"01\" data-atlas-label=\"Business & technology\"><span class=\"atlas-index\">01</span><span><strong>Portfolio</strong><small>Business & technology</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a><a href=\"/trading\" data-atlas-number=\"02\" data-atlas-label=\"Trade With Zuko\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"atlas-index\">02</span><span><strong>Trading World</strong><small>Trade With Zuko · You are here</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a><a href=\"/youtube\" data-atlas-number=\"03\" data-atlas-label=\"Life, filmed differently\"><span class=\"atlas-index\">03</span><span><strong>YouTube</strong><small>Life, filmed differently</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a><a href=\"/instagram\" data-atlas-number=\"04\" data-atlas-label=\"Moments & perspectives\"><span class=\"atlas-index\">04</span><span><strong>Instagram</strong><small>Moments & perspectives</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a></nav></div><p class=\"atlas-dialog-note\"><span>BUSINESS · MARKETS · STORIES · PERSPECTIVES</span><span>ESC TO CLOSE</span></p></dialog>",
  "rail": "<section class=\"atlas-rail shell\" aria-label=\"Explore the four worlds\"><div class=\"atlas-rail-head\"><span>THE AMAN ATLAS / FOUR CONNECTED WORLDS</span><span>CHOOSE YOUR COORDINATES ↗</span></div><nav class=\"atlas-route\" aria-label=\"Choose a world\"><a class=\"atlas-stop\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"atlas-planet\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\"/><path d=\"M17 17h14v14H17z M13 24h-4m30 0h-4M24 9v4m0 22v4\"/></svg><span><small>01 / THE PROFESSIONAL WORLD</small><strong>Portfolio</strong></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a><a class=\"atlas-stop\" href=\"/trading\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"atlas-planet\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\"/><path d=\"M13 17v17m-3-13h6v9h-6zM24 10v22m-3-16h6v10h-6zM35 17v22m-3-18h6v12h-6z\"/></svg><span><small>02 / THE MARKET LAB</small><strong>Trading World</strong></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a><a class=\"atlas-stop\" href=\"/youtube\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"atlas-planet\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\"/><path d=\"M19 15l15 9-15 9z\"/></svg><span><small>03 / THE STORY STUDIO</small><strong>YouTube</strong></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a><a class=\"atlas-stop\" href=\"/instagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle class=\"atlas-planet\" cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"22\"/><path d=\"M15 13h18a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H15a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V15a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM30 17h1\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"5\"/></svg><span><small>04 / THE PHOTO JOURNAL</small><strong>Instagram</strong></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</b></a></nav></section>",
  "labs": "<section class=\"world-section shell\" id=\"market-basics\">\n  <div class=\"section-top reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE MARKET LAB / START WITH UNDERSTANDING</p><h2>Behind every candle,<br>there’s a decision.</h2><p>Trading is the buying and selling of financial instruments. Price changes as orders meet; charts summarize those transactions. Understanding the mechanics comes before taking any risk.</p></div><span class=\"lab-coordinate\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LAB<br>01—04</span></div>\n  <div class=\"foundation-grid\">\n    <article class=\"foundation-card reveal\"><div class=\"foundation-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 120\"><path class=\"lab-grid\" d=\"M20 25h220M20 60h220M20 95h220\"/><path class=\"lab-line\" pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M20 85 50 65 76 75 102 42 125 58 154 28 179 45 210 19 240 30\"/><circle class=\"lab-pulse\" cx=\"210\" cy=\"19\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><small>01 / CONTEXT</small><h3>Trading isn’t investing.</h3><p>Trading usually focuses on shorter-term price changes. Investing generally has a longer horizon and looks at the underlying business or asset. Neither approach removes the possibility of loss.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"foundation-card reveal\"><div class=\"foundation-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 120\"><path class=\"lab-grid\" d=\"M20 25h220M20 60h220M20 95h220\"/><g class=\"order-bars\"><path d=\"M130 20H70M130 40H40M130 60H90M130 80H55M130 100H20\"/><path d=\"M135 20h85M135 40h55M135 60h105M135 80h70M135 100h40\"/></g></svg></div><small>02 / OBSERVATION</small><h3>Price action tells a story.</h3><p>Read the open, high, low and close alongside swing highs, swing lows, zones and volume. A pattern is an observation to test in context—not a promise about the next candle.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"foundation-card reveal\"><div class=\"foundation-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 120\"><circle class=\"lab-grid\" cx=\"130\" cy=\"60\" r=\"43\"/><circle class=\"risk-orbit\" cx=\"130\" cy=\"60\" r=\"52\"/><path class=\"lab-line\" d=\"m130 26 28 12v25c0 18-28 31-28 31s-28-13-28-31V38z\"/><path class=\"lab-line\" d=\"m118 59 9 9 17-20\"/></svg></div><small>03 / SURVIVAL</small><h3>Risk comes first.</h3><p>Leverage magnifies losses as well as gains. Learn position sizing, transaction costs, slippage and why a stop order cannot guarantee an exit price. Paper practice is not proof of real-world profitability.</p></article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"world-section shell\" id=\"price-action\">\n  <div class=\"section-top reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">02 / PRICE ACTION, MADE VISIBLE</p><h2>Learn to read<br>one candle first.</h2><p>Each candle compresses a chosen time interval into four prices. Change the example to see what an upward or downward close actually means.</p></div><span class=\"demo-tag\">ILLUSTRATIONS · NOT LIVE DATA</span></div>\n  <div class=\"lab-split\">\n    <div class=\"lab-panel candle-panel reveal\"><div class=\"lab-panel-top\"><span>CANDLE ANATOMY</span><span>OHLC / EXAMPLE</span></div>\n      <div class=\"lesson-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose candle example\"><button type=\"button\" data-candle=\"up\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-controls=\"candle-figure\">Up candle ↗</button><button type=\"button\" data-candle=\"down\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"candle-figure\">Down candle ↘</button></div>\n      <svg id=\"candle-figure\" class=\"candle-figure\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 345\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"candle-svg-title candle-svg-desc\"><title id=\"candle-svg-title\">Up candle: open 100, high 110, low 96, close 106</title><desc id=\"candle-svg-desc\">The body joins open and close. The wick reaches the interval’s high and low. All values are hypothetical price units.</desc><path class=\"lab-grid\" d=\"M30 75H490M30 135H490M30 225H490M30 285H490M90 40V310M205 40V310M320 40V310M435 40V310\"/><rect class=\"candle-aura\" x=\"143\" y=\"105\" width=\"124\" height=\"150\" rx=\"40\"/><path class=\"anatomy-wick\" d=\"M205 75V285\"/><rect class=\"anatomy-body\" x=\"173\" y=\"135\" width=\"64\" height=\"90\" rx=\"3\"/><g class=\"candle-guides\"><path d=\"M205 75H325M237 135H325M237 225H325M205 285H325\"/></g><g class=\"candle-labels\"><text x=\"340\" y=\"79\">HIGH<tspan x=\"405\" data-candle-high>110</tspan></text><text x=\"340\" y=\"139\"><tspan data-upper-label>CLOSE</tspan><tspan x=\"405\">106</tspan></text><text x=\"340\" y=\"229\"><tspan data-lower-label>OPEN</tspan><tspan x=\"405\">100</tspan></text><text x=\"340\" y=\"289\">LOW<tspan x=\"405\">96</tspan></text><text class=\"candle-axis-note\" x=\"35\" y=\"330\">ONE TIME INTERVAL · HYPOTHETICAL PRICE UNITS</text></g></svg>\n      <dl class=\"candle-values\" aria-label=\"Hypothetical candle prices\"><div><dt>Open</dt><dd data-open-value>100</dd></div><div><dt>High</dt><dd>110</dd></div><div><dt>Low</dt><dd>96</dd></div><div><dt>Close</dt><dd data-close-value>106</dd></div></dl>\n      <p class=\"candle-summary\" data-candle-summary role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Close 106 is above open 100: the price rose during this interval. This says nothing certain about the next interval.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lesson-notes reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE READING ORDER</p><h3>A small shape.<br>Four useful clues.</h3><ol class=\"reading-steps\"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>The body</strong><p>The distance between open and close. A larger body means a larger net move over that interval, not necessarily a better trading opportunity.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>The wicks</strong><p>The extremes reached above and below the body. A wick alone does not reveal who traded, why they traded or where price will go.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>The surrounding chart</strong><p>Compare the candle with nearby price swings, the timeframe and volume. The same shape can occur in very different market conditions.</p></div></li></ol><div class=\"lesson-caution\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↳</span><p>A chart is a record of price, not a forecast. Start by describing what happened before speculating about what might happen.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"world-section shell\" id=\"patterns\">\n  <div class=\"section-top reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 / INTERACTIVE PATTERN STUDIO</p><h2>See the structure.<br>Question the outcome.</h2><p>Choose a pattern to explore its shape, the context to examine and how the idea can fail.</p></div><span class=\"demo-tag\">SCHEMATIC CHARTS · NO SIGNALS</span></div>\n  <div class=\"pattern-studio lab-panel reveal\">\n    <div class=\"lesson-buttons pattern-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose chart pattern\"><button type=\"button\" data-pattern=\"range\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-controls=\"pattern-visual pattern-explanation\">Range &amp; breakout</button><button type=\"button\" data-pattern=\"double\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pattern-visual pattern-explanation\">Double top</button><button type=\"button\" data-pattern=\"triangle\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pattern-visual pattern-explanation\">Ascending triangle</button></div>\n    <div class=\"pattern-layout\"><div class=\"pattern-visual\" id=\"pattern-visual\"><div class=\"lab-panel-top\"><span data-pattern-tag>01 / RANGE &amp; BREAKOUT</span><span>PRICE STRUCTURE</span></div>\n      <svg class=\"pattern-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 365\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"pattern-svg-title pattern-svg-desc\"><title id=\"pattern-svg-title\">Range and possible breakout</title><desc id=\"pattern-svg-desc\">Illustrative price swings between support and resistance. A dashed extension shows one possible outcome, not a forecast.</desc><defs><linearGradient id=\"pattern-zone-fill\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#bda8ff\" stop-opacity=\".14\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#95dfef\" stop-opacity=\".02\"/></linearGradient></defs><path class=\"lab-grid\" d=\"M40 45H640M40 100H640M40 155H640M40 210H640M40 265H640M40 320H640M80 35V320M180 35V320M280 35V320M380 35V320M480 35V320M580 35V320\"/><path class=\"pattern-zone\" data-pattern-zone d=\"M55 100H555V255H55Z\"/><path class=\"pattern-level\" data-pattern-guide d=\"M55 100H565M55 255H565\"/><path class=\"pattern-price\" data-pattern-price pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M55 200 100 105 145 250 195 108 245 252 295 102 345 240 390 108 440 240 490 140\"/><path class=\"pattern-future\" data-pattern-future pathLength=\"1\" d=\"M490 140 530 85 565 100 605 60\"/><circle class=\"pattern-current\" data-pattern-dot cx=\"490\" cy=\"140\" r=\"5\"/><text class=\"chart-annotation\" data-pattern-label x=\"55\" y=\"84\">RESISTANCE ZONE</text><text class=\"chart-annotation secondary-label\" data-pattern-label-two x=\"55\" y=\"280\">SUPPORT ZONE</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"40\" y=\"350\">EARLIER</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"518\" y=\"350\">SEQUENCE →</text></svg>\n      <div class=\"chart-key\"><span><i></i>Illustrated price history</span><span><i class=\"dashed\"></i>One possible outcome</span></div>\n    </div><div class=\"pattern-explanation\" id=\"pattern-explanation\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">WHAT YOU’RE SEEING</p><h3 data-pattern-title>Range &amp; breakout</h3><p data-pattern-copy>Price has repeatedly turned near an upper resistance area and a lower support area. A move beyond the range may continue, or quickly return inside it.</p><div class=\"pattern-detail\"><small>LOOK FOR CONTEXT</small><p data-pattern-context>Compare several touches, closing prices, volume and the broader trend. Support and resistance are areas, not exact barriers.</p></div><div class=\"pattern-detail failure\"><small>HOW THE IDEA CAN FAIL</small><p data-pattern-failure>A brief move above resistance can reverse into the range. A breakout alone is not confirmation of a lasting trend.</p></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"small-note\">These are simplified teaching diagrams. Patterns can fail, are interpreted subjectively and do not provide reliable standalone predictions. <a href=\"https://zerodha.com/varsity/chapter/support-resistance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Read more about support and resistance ↗</a></p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"world-section shell\" id=\"option-chain\">\n  <div class=\"section-top reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">04 / THE NIFTY OPTION-CHAIN LAB</p><h2>Understand the table.<br>Not just the numbers.</h2><p>A Nifty option chain organizes calls and puts by strike and expiry. Use this fictional example to explore the fields. It is not connected to an exchange.</p></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.nseindia.com/option-chain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open NSE’s actual option chain ↗</a></div>\n  <div class=\"option-lab lab-panel reveal\" data-chain-field=\"strike\">\n    <div class=\"option-lab-header\"><div><span class=\"demo-tag\">SIMULATION / NOT LIVE MARKET DATA</span><h3>NIFTY <span>50 / OPTION CHAIN</span></h3></div><div class=\"spot-reference\"><small>Hypothetical index level</small><strong>24,000 <span>points</span></strong><small>One hypothetical expiry · No current contract details</small></div></div>\n    <div class=\"chain-how\"><strong>Try it:</strong> select a strike, then explore a column below. The example prices stay fixed.</div>\n    <div class=\"chain-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Illustrative Nifty option chain. Scroll horizontally on small screens.\"><table class=\"chain-table\"><caption>Fictional Nifty option chain. Premiums in index points; open interest (OI) in contracts; implied volatility (IV) in percent. No live quotes.</caption><thead><tr class=\"chain-sides\"><th scope=\"colgroup\" colspan=\"3\">CALLS / CE</th><th scope=\"col\">STRIKE</th><th scope=\"colgroup\" colspan=\"3\">PUTS / PE</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"oi\">OI</th><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"iv\">IV %</th><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"premium\">Premium / pts</th><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"strike\">Select a strike ↓</th><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"premium\">Premium / pts</th><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"iv\">IV %</th><th scope=\"col\" data-field=\"oi\">OI</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n      <tr data-strike-row=\"23900\"><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell\"><i style=\"--oi:41%\"></i><b>1,340</b></span></td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"premium\">170</td><th scope=\"row\" data-field=\"strike\"><button type=\"button\" data-strike=\"23900\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"strike-insight\" aria-label=\"Inspect strike 23,900\">23,900</button></th><td data-field=\"premium\">70</td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell put-oi\"><i style=\"--oi:92%\"></i><b>3,000</b></span></td></tr>\n      <tr data-strike-row=\"23950\"><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell\"><i style=\"--oi:52%\"></i><b>1,680</b></span></td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"premium\">135</td><th scope=\"row\" data-field=\"strike\"><button type=\"button\" data-strike=\"23950\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"strike-insight\" aria-label=\"Inspect strike 23,950\">23,950</button></th><td data-field=\"premium\">85</td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell put-oi\"><i style=\"--oi:68%\"></i><b>2,200</b></span></td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"selected-strike\" data-strike-row=\"24000\"><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell\"><i style=\"--oi:71%\"></i><b>2,300</b></span></td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"premium\">110</td><th scope=\"row\" data-field=\"strike\"><button type=\"button\" data-strike=\"24000\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-controls=\"strike-insight\" aria-label=\"Inspect strike 24,000, at the money\">24,000 <small>ATM</small></button></th><td data-field=\"premium\">110</td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell put-oi\"><i style=\"--oi:65%\"></i><b>2,100</b></span></td></tr>\n      <tr data-strike-row=\"24050\"><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell\"><i style=\"--oi:79%\"></i><b>2,580</b></span></td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"premium\">85</td><th scope=\"row\" data-field=\"strike\"><button type=\"button\" data-strike=\"24050\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"strike-insight\" aria-label=\"Inspect strike 24,050\">24,050</button></th><td data-field=\"premium\">135</td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell put-oi\"><i style=\"--oi:47%\"></i><b>1,520</b></span></td></tr>\n      <tr data-strike-row=\"24100\"><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell\"><i style=\"--oi:100%\"></i><b>3,250</b></span></td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"premium\">70</td><th scope=\"row\" data-field=\"strike\"><button type=\"button\" data-strike=\"24100\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"strike-insight\" aria-label=\"Inspect strike 24,100\">24,100</button></th><td data-field=\"premium\">170</td><td data-field=\"iv\">18.0</td><td data-field=\"oi\"><span class=\"oi-cell put-oi\"><i style=\"--oi:38%\"></i><b>1,250</b></span></td></tr>\n    </tbody></table></div>\n    <p class=\"chain-scroll-hint\">Small screen? Swipe the table ↔ · Figures are deliberately simplified, not generated by an option-pricing model.</p>\n    <div class=\"strike-insight\" id=\"strike-insight\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><div><small>SELECTED STRIKE</small><strong data-selected-strike>24,000</strong><p>Index reference: 24,000</p></div><div><small>CALL / CE</small><strong data-call-money>At the money</strong><p data-call-intrinsic>Intrinsic value: 0 points</p></div><div><small>PUT / PE</small><strong data-put-money>At the money</strong><p data-put-intrinsic>Intrinsic value: 0 points</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"chain-explainer\"><div class=\"lesson-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explain an option-chain field\"><button type=\"button\" data-chain=\"strike\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-controls=\"chain-field-explanation\">Strike &amp; expiry</button><button type=\"button\" data-chain=\"premium\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"chain-field-explanation\">Premium</button><button type=\"button\" data-chain=\"oi\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"chain-field-explanation\">Open interest</button><button type=\"button\" data-chain=\"iv\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-controls=\"chain-field-explanation\">Implied volatility</button></div><div id=\"chain-field-explanation\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><h4 data-field-title>Strike &amp; expiry: identify the contract.</h4><p data-field-copy>The strike is the contract’s reference price. Expiry is when it ends. Compare calls and puts for the same expiry. At a 24,000 index level, the 24,000 strike is at the money; lower strikes have positive call intrinsic value, and higher strikes have positive put intrinsic value.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"greeks-heading reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">BEYOND DIRECTION / FOUR RISK SENSITIVITIES</p><h3>An index can move your way.<br>Your option can still lose value.</h3><p>Greeks estimate sensitivity with other factors held constant. They change with market conditions; they are not fixed promises.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"greeks-grid\">\n    <article class=\"greek-card reveal\"><span class=\"greek-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Δ</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 65H170M10 65V8\" class=\"lab-grid\"/><path d=\"M15 58 160 15\" class=\"lab-line\"/></svg><h4>Delta / direction</h4><p>How much the premium is estimated to change for a small move in the underlying.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"greek-card reveal\"><span class=\"greek-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Γ</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 65H170M10 65V8\" class=\"lab-grid\"/><path d=\"M15 58Q115 63 160 12\" class=\"lab-line\"/></svg><h4>Gamma / acceleration</h4><p>How delta changes as the underlying moves. Sensitivity can change quickly near expiry.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"greek-card reveal\"><span class=\"greek-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Θ</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 65H170M10 65V8\" class=\"lab-grid\"/><path d=\"M15 13Q115 12 160 62\" class=\"lab-line\"/></svg><h4>Theta / passing time</h4><p>The effect of time passing. Bought options generally lose time value, all else equal.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"greek-card reveal\"><span class=\"greek-glyph\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ν</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 65H170M10 65V8\" class=\"lab-grid\"/><path d=\"M15 60Q75 25 160 12\" class=\"lab-line\"/></svg><h4>Vega / volatility</h4><p>Sensitivity to implied volatility. Falling IV can reduce a bought option’s premium.</p></article>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"risk-banner reveal\"><span class=\"risk-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">!</span><div><h3>Know the downside before studying the upside.</h3><p>An option buyer can lose the entire premium paid, plus costs. Uncovered option selling can involve much larger losses; an uncovered call’s loss is theoretically unlimited. Intrinsic value is not profit. These examples exclude lot size, transaction costs and settlement details.</p><p>Contract specifications, expiry rules and lot sizes can change. Check the exchange and your broker before making any real-world decision. This page does not recommend a strike, expiry or strategy.</p></div></div>\n  <p class=\"small-note\">Further reading: <a href=\"https://zerodha.com/varsity/chapter/moneyness-of-an-option-contract/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">option moneyness</a> · <a href=\"https://zerodha.com/varsity/chapter/open-interest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">open interest vs volume</a> · <a href=\"https://support.zerodha.com/category/account-opening/glossary/futures-and-options/articles/what-are-option-greeks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">option Greeks</a>. Original illustrations; no affiliation with NSE or Zerodha.</p>\n</section>\n\n",
